      "value": "@{6035ec519adad6780b906c51|full_name}: The problem with toggling the object or component off is that it would disable whatever grabbed it, causing it to re-enable the parameter.\nFor example, say I grabbed my ear. Then I used the Ear_IsGrabbed parameter to reset the component with Is Animated disabled. When I disable the component, it also makes it unable to be grabbed, thus resetting Ear_IsGrabbed to false, and undoing the change.\nYes, you could set a delay for reverting Is Animated back to true, but either way, people would have to grab the bone twice in quick succession to hold it.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
