  "details": "This is specifically an issue with grabbing, not colliding, so far as I can tell.\nMultiple people have tried using an animation to toggle \"Is Animated\" at runtime (i.e. disable that while grabbing, or only enable while a specific animation is happening) but it appears to make no difference at runtime.\nGIF illustrating the issue courtesy of Joshuarox100.",
